BabyCare AI local document drop folder
=====================================

Place additional pediatric guidelines here as PDF, HTML, or TXT files.

Then add one row per file to docs/manifest.csv:
filename,title,organization,date,category,notes

Rules:
- Use only documents you are permitted to store and process locally.
- Do not add documents containing identifiable patient information.
- The app indexes only documents recorded in this manifest or data/sources.csv.
- References shown in reports come only from indexed chunks.
- A missing document is never treated as evidence of normal findings.
- Hand-compiled graph and investigation entries require clinician validation.
